Mitigating urban light pollution: A review of municipal regulations and implications for planners
By
Kameshwari Pothukuchi, Ph.D.
Department of Urban Studies and Planning, Wayne State University 3198 Faculty Administration Building, 636 W Kirby, Detroit, MI 48202 k.pothukuchi@wayne.edu
Preprint of a paper published in Journal of Urban Affairs doi.org/10.1080/07352166.2023.2247506
